WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:07.041
Once upon a time, there was a young prince.

2
00:00:07.042 --> 00:00:11.861
He smiled and laughed all day long.

3
00:00:11.862 --> 00:00:19.124
His parents, the king and queen, always said, "You're the perfect child!"

4
00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:24.446
And they made sure the prince got everything he ever wanted.

5
00:00:24.447 --> 00:00:27.782
And reader, I mean everything

6
00:00:27.783 --> 00:00:37.166
! He said, "I want a pony!" His parents gave him

7
00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:41.630
ten. He said, "I want a new

8
00:00:41.631 --> 00:00:46.499
belt!" They gave him one with two rubies and a

9
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.220
sapphire. You might think that was why the prince was so

10
00:00:50.221 --> 00:00:54.499
happy. But you'd be

11
00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:00.212
wrong. The prince was happy because he never got into

12
00:01:00.213 --> 00:01:10.559
trouble. Not even when he behaved badly, which was most

13
00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:15.068
days! A nursemaid, Nana, watched over the

14
00:01:15.069 --> 00:01:20.832
prince. Nana was loving and gentle—and very good at her

15
00:01:20.833 --> 00:01:29.412
job. Every day she'd gently remind him, "You are a very smart

16
00:01:29.413 --> 00:01:32.661
boy." Every night she'd tuck him into

17
00:01:32.662 --> 00:01:38.615
bed. "A wonderful future awaits you, my precious

18
00:01:38.616 --> 00:01:43.194
prince." But there was one thing Nana hadn't yet succeeded in

19
00:01:43.195 --> 00:01:46.999
doing. And it bothered her

20
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.499
deeply. "I was sent to this castle for one

21
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:57.063
reason. I must make sure he becomes a kind

22
00:01:57.064 --> 00:02:01.560
king." So, she kept trying to teach him to be kind.

23
00:02:01.561 --> 00:02:07.707
"Your kingdom has many poor and sad families," she'd say.

24
00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:19.004
The prince would just shrug. "Oh well! My family is rich and happy!"

25
00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:23.089
Nana finally went to the king for advice.

26
00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:27.375
When the king heard how his son was acting, he grinned.

27
00:02:27.376 --> 00:02:35.582
"Wonderful news! He will make a fine king one day!"

28
00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:38.818
Next, Nana went to the queen.

29
00:02:38.819 --> 00:02:47.774
But the queen covered her ears. "My son is a perfect angel!"

30
00:02:47.775 --> 00:02:53.533
Nana knew then that she was all on her own.

31
00:02:53.534 --> 00:02:58.487
She was the only one who could teach the prince about kindness.

32
00:02:58.488 --> 00:03:03.823
But time was running out.

33
00:03:03.824 --> 00:03:07.332
"The prince is growing up," she thought.

34
00:03:07.333 --> 00:03:11.101
"Soon he won't need me anymore.

35
00:03:11.102 --> 00:03:16.724
Yet his heart is growing harder and colder by the day."

36
00:03:16.725 --> 00:03:21.811
It was time to do something—something magical.

37
00:03:21.812 --> 00:03:30.562
You see, reader, Nana wasn't just a nursemaid. She was a fairy.

38
00:03:30.563 --> 00:03:34.874
And it was the fairy queen who had sent her there.

39
00:03:34.875 --> 00:03:43.457
"The next king must be kind and fair," the fairy queen had said.

40
00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:48.055
Nana had never used magic at the castle before.

41
00:03:48.056 --> 00:03:58.898
"But now," she thought, "I will do what I must do."

